Third-party colour palettes in themes/:

- Gruvbox, by Pavel Pertsev (https://github.com/morhetz/gruvbox), MIT.
- Tokyo Night, by enkia (https://github.com/enkia/tokyo-night-vscode-theme), MIT.

The palette values were taken from Omabuntu's theme files
(https://github.com/omakasui/omabuntu), which its README states are MIT;
the repository publishes no separate copyright notice.
